(115,042 real changes made, 115,042 to missing)

. 
. foreach v of varlist kidsex01-kidsex19 {
  2.     replace `v' = . if `v' < 0
  3. }
(32,009 real changes made, 32,009 to missing)
(54,844 real changes made, 54,844 to missing)
(90,913 real changes made, 90,913 to missing)
(106,639 real changes made, 106,639 to missing)
(111,932 real changes made, 111,932 to missing)
